Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if trimming outliers improves over the weighted pool1 winner.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a DBA (Dynamic Bayesian averaging) on the full model pool to see if it can outperform the current weighted pool1 winner.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the small pool1 using the default inverse_error weighting (not the w2 handle) to see if a fresh weight estimate on the reduced set improves over the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination over the full pool with inverse_error weighting to see if including all models improves over the best pool1 result.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Evaluate a simple mean combination on the smaller pool1 to see if reducing variance of weighted gives better SMAPE.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 to see if adding more models improves SMAPE over the best mean pool1 result.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool1 using softmax_neg_error to see if a different weighting scheme improves over the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

Thought: Test a median combination on the larger pool2 to see if a robust central tendency across more models improves SMAPE over the current best weighted pool2.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a DBA approach on pool1 to see if iterative consensus improves SMAPE over the best median pool2.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool3 with inverse_error to see if adding ETS/THETA improves over pool1 DBA.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

